license: CC-BY-4.0
abstract: >-
  An explicit rational continuous DSIC stream-dual witness and exact
  Bernstein certificate give a global upper bound for the canonical
  two-bidder, two-item independent-uniform auction; an exact layered
  deterministic mechanism supplies a separate lower bound. The upper bound
  has an independent full replay; lower-layer replays recompute added gains
  while sharing one exact base-revenue verifier. The unrestricted optimum
  remains open, and the deterministic mechanism earns at least 98.7408% of
  the unrestricted optimal revenue.
